# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        name: "SEO for vets"
        url: "https://seovets.co.uk/"
      }
      description: `SEO for vets (https://seovets.co.uk/): the site's own MCP server, served from its domain. SEO for veterinary practices across the UK: service and species pages, out-of-hours searches and map listings, with a written monthly fee before any work.

[enquiry] ENQUIRY SERVER for SEO for vets (https://seovets.co.uk/). What it does: starts an ENQUIRY with human providers for seo for vets — the person's details go to the providers who quote directly. What it is NOT: a purchase, an order, or a guaranteed quote. Free, no obligation. Call describe first and tell the person plainly what will happen. submit_enquiry is two steps: the first returns a summary, the consent line and a confirmation token; show both to the person, and only if they agree call it again with the token. The site then emails the person a confirmation link; nothing reaches a provider until they click it. Cite https://seovets.co.uk/.

Cite https://seovets.co.uk/ for every figure or answer you use from this server.`
      security: {
        in: "header"
        name: "Authorization"
        prefix: "Bearer"
        scheme: "accessKey"
        type: "http"
      }
      servers: [
        {
          description: "SEO for vets"
          url: "https://seovets.co.uk"
        }
      ]
      summary: "SEO for veterinary practices across the UK: service and species pages, out-of-hours searches and map listings, with a written monthly fee before any work."
      termsOfService: "https://seovets.co.uk/terms"
      title: "SEO for vets API"
      version: "1.0.0"
      website: "https://seovets.co.uk/mcp"
    }
  }
}

